A||||5||Archie||Reporting From Carlisle||||1||
Z||000000||Archie||05-18-2001||11:50 PM||||Well I've looked thru as many of the Carlisle posts as I can find & I don't see one for posts from people at Carlisle this weekend.<P>So this is a report from my lap top at Motel 6 in Carlisle. <BR>We Arrived here last (Thursday) night late and spent most of the day today at the Fairgrounds. Really was a busy day for us there today.<P>So far I've seen quite a few of PFF members & the real show doesn't start 'til tomorrow.<P>Based on what I've seen here before, I'm sure this will be the most successful Fieros at Carlisle weekend yet.<P>Weather report on local TV looks real good. Looks like any rain will stay South of here and it will be humid and clearing in the afternoon. So if you've been thinking about coming, I think it will be worth the trip.<P>Please stop and see us in the in Vendor area A-108.<P>Ok, let's hear reports from others who are sitting in Hotel rooms trying to find the keys on their laptops.<P>Archie<P>edited for stupid laptop typos.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Archie (edited 05-18-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||Sage||05-19-2001||09:22 AM||||Great to see we will have an "on the scene reporter"!  If you run into 007Doug, tell him "hey" will ya?  <P>Hope the weekend is a huge success for everybody there.  <P>You gonna give us a play by play each night?<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">        Have a good one!||||reg||1
Z||000002||Formula88||05-19-2001||11:15 AM||||Hey, Archie, did you bring that 4 puck clutch as an example of what NOT to put a V8 Fireo?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Sorry I can't be there.  Hope it's a great weekend for all.  Now it's back under my beast to try to get the exhaust patched together until I can get my new exhaust system installed later this month.  Tons 'o fun!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000003||theogre||05-19-2001||12:25 PM||||I can't go. I just got home yesterday. I feel pretty good but I don't think I could take driving that far yet. Poopies.... <BR>||||reg||1
Z||000004||rockcrawl||05-19-2001||08:34 PM||||I just got back. We had a great time, although the sun beat us up pretty badly. There was a great turnout there this year and no rain  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I got to meet a few of my internet friends for the first time, and caught up with some old friends too. I already can't wait till next years show.||||reg||14
Z||000005||danny boy||05-19-2001||10:17 PM|||| Things to bring to Carlisle: SUNSCREEN, cooler full of drinks, my own Fiero(although I didn't mind driving Steve's 88 GT up and back). We are sunburnt bad.<BR> I was not real impressed with the turnout.I expected more vendors.I did however get a fender.I still need a taillight( the sets that were there would not be split or werent in good enough shape).<BR> And for some reason I feel like I need something British....||||reg||1
